# Dart / Flutter

- Match neighboring code: imports, naming, Riverpod/Drift patterns.
- Prefer `ui_kit` `Kit*` widgets over one-off Material styling.
- Money amounts: use existing Toman helpers in `packages/core` — no ad-hoc formatting.
- Dates: Jalali helpers in `core` when UI is Persian calendar.
- No new HTTP clients or remote APIs. Persistence via `packages/local_db` / Drift.
- Keep diffs focused; no drive-by refactors or unrelated file churn.
